Notices:

  This repository is a reproduction of the paper:
  "Physics-informed neural network for lithium-ion battery degradation
   stable modeling and prognosis"
  published in Nature Communications, 2024, 15:4332
  DOI: 10.1038/s41467-024-48779-z

  The original code is available at:
  https://github.com/wang-fujin/PINN4SOH

  This reproduction includes:
  - Environment compatibility fixes (Python 3.7 -> 3.12, PyTorch 1.7 -> 2.11)
  - One-click execution script (run_all.py)
  - Complete technical documentation in Chinese (docs/)
  - Reproduction report with detailed results comparison
